# OPUS-TYPED-BINDING-20260930-20, next_core_tasks.md §3 item 207: at the walked root `Model: b c` with b absent and c a Model
# declares b bound to c's descriptor -- no merge, no copy: a write through b is read through c.  c of a named Structure
# is admitted at translation by what b's body uses of it (the one admission a formal's actual takes).  Entry 7.
Model:
    size_t: value 1U
end: Model

Other:
    int: p 1
    int: q 2
end: Other

int: out 0
Model: c
c\value: 5U
Model: b c
b\value: 9U
if: c\value = 9U
    out: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: out; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
